  "sharedModel": [
    "Resolve root padding and border declarations with one bounded edge-priority collector. Retain used border widths and colors as pure values; none/hidden styles have zero used width, nonzero subpixel widths use at least one CSS pixel, and percentage widths remain unsupported.",
    "Preparation and rendering share border-plus-padding insets, snapped outer-box projection, CSS box paint coordinates and pre-snapped content clips. Logical sizing, text layout and SVG percentage bases remain unchanged.",
    "Paint border commands inside root source opacity and before content clipping. Empty roots retain their box paint; root visibility suppresses border paint while explicit visible children keep their insets. Outer image generation preserves its display contract.",
    "Uniform borders reuse rectangle-frame coverage. Translucent partial borders fill one side union. Distinct colors use native side order and miters; at most four opacity groups reuse analytic paths and existing layer restoration, reserving any required storage before allocation and releasing on every exit.",
    "The integer device image viewport clips the fractional image AA footprint without another AA multiplication. It is independent of bitmap allocation, SVG content projection and CSS border geometry."
  ],
